OL,3,AChristian festival 'devastated' after
OL,4,Aman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of a Christian festival say
OL,7,Fthey are "devastated" after a man died
OL,8,Fand six other people were injured by a
OL,9,Ffalling sign.
OL,11,FSussex Police said it had been called
OL,12,Fto the Big Church Festival at Wiston
OL,13,FPark, near Steyning in West Sussex, at
OL,14,Fabout 15:38 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FIt was later confirmed a 41-year-old
OL,17,Fman from Eastbourne in East Sussex had
OL,18,Fdied.
OL,20,FThe Archbishop of Canterbury said she
OL,21,Fwas "sad and shocked" to hear about the
OL,22,Ffatal incident.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/37
