OL,3,ACleverly quits shadow cabinet to run
OL,4,Afor London mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative MP Sir James Cleverly has
OL,7,Fsaid he is resigning from the shadow
OL,8,Fcabinet to run for London mayor.
OL,10,F"I am putting myself forward to be the
OL,11,FConservative candidate for mayor of
OL,12,FLondon, because our capital needs more
OL,13,Fthan an administrator," he wrote in the
OL,14,FTimes.
OL,16,FSir James said he has told Tory leader
OL,17,FKemi Badenoch he is stepping down as
OL,18,Fshadow housing secretary, saying: "I
OL,19,Fmust be free to speak about every
OL,20,Faspect of London's future and
OL,21,Fconcentrate fully on winning this
OL,22,Frace."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
