OL,3,ATrump hails 'historic' deal for US to
OL,4,Acontrol 65bn barrels of Venezuela's oil
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some analysts have reacted with
OL,7,Fscepticism, including questioning
OL,8,Fwhether the deal would address
OL,9,Flong-running obstacles that have
OL,10,Fdeterred investment in Venezuela's oil
OL,11,Findustry.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/37
